# EN: paper artefacts. Every file in bench/paper/ is GENERATED by bench/report.py from bench/results/,
#   which is itself gitignored. Versioning a figure means versioning a number that can go stale against the
#   data that produced it, which is the drift this project keeps finding in its own documents. Regenerate
#   with `python -m bench.report`. Only *.png was ignored before, so the .pdf, .csv and .tex were versioned.
#   PT: artefato de artigo. Tudo em bench/paper/ e GERADO pelo bench/report.py a partir do bench/results/,
#   que ja esta fora do git. Versionar figura e versionar numero q pode envelhecer contra o dado q o gerou.
bench/paper/
